WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.306
A living technical book is not a document that changes often.

2
00:00:04.306 --> 00:00:08.552
It is a system that can change without losing its source

3
00:00:08.552 --> 00:00:12.797
identity, claim history, failed tests, or public truth. New papers arrive,

4
00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:16.657
chapters split, proof targets move, support can strengthen or weaken,

5
00:00:16.657 --> 00:00:17.815
and derivatives drift.

6
00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:23.261
A static PDF freezes one moment. A loose wiki changes without

7
00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:28.366
enough discipline. A code repository can validate shape without explaining the

8
00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:33.472
thesis. The ASI Stack therefore treats each substantive change as an

9
00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:37.185
Evidence-Preserving Publication Transaction over a governed artifact graph.

10
00:00:37.785 --> 00:00:42.005
The transaction first freezes the objective, canonical commit,

11
00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:47.808
affected chapters and claims, audience, authority, rights, release target, environment, time,

12
00:00:47.808 --> 00:00:49.390
and explicit non-claims.

13
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:55.373
Stable identities bind sources, passages, claims, proof targets, tests, figures, derivatives,

14
00:00:55.373 --> 00:01:00.503
releases, residuals, corrections, and successor work. Intake keeps source report,

15
00:01:00.503 --> 00:01:04.607
author intent, synthesis, experiment, formal proof, editorial judgment,

16
00:01:04.607 --> 00:01:07.685
and open question in separate lanes.

17
00:01:08.025 --> 00:01:12.284
A source count does not become evidence. A theorem build does

18
00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:16.155
not become enforcement. A polished paragraph does not become support.

19
00:01:16.755 --> 00:01:21.666
Each material claim is then atomized enough to name its scope,

20
00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:26.577
falsifier, evidence lanes, source mappings, contrary evidence, disposition, promotion ceiling, residual,

21
00:01:26.577 --> 00:01:31.489
and consumers. A typed change packet records what will move and

22
00:01:31.489 --> 00:01:31.935
why.

23
00:01:32.275 --> 00:01:37.913
Canonical records regenerate the outline, proof manifest, appendices, status surfaces,

24
00:01:37.913 --> 00:01:39.605
and reader projections.

25
00:01:39.945 --> 00:01:45.988
Validation is surface-specific: schema, semantics, sources, proofs, executables, negative controls, rights,

26
00:01:45.988 --> 00:01:52.032
accessibility, render, browser, release, reproducibility, deployment, and public observation remain different

27
00:01:52.032 --> 00:01:58.075
gates. Green is meaningful only for the contract that produced it.

28
00:01:58.675 --> 00:02:01.855
Derivatives are projections, not rival books.

29
00:02:02.195 --> 00:02:07.526
The AI and research view, Human view, reader manuscript, HTML, DOCX,

30
00:02:07.526 --> 00:02:12.856
EPUB, PDF, article, header image, audio, and chapter videos all bind

31
00:02:12.856 --> 00:02:17.702
the exact source commit, audience, transform policy, review state, approval,

32
00:02:17.702 --> 00:02:20.125
evidence effect, residuals, and non-claims.

33
00:02:20.465 --> 00:02:26.446
Generation, inspection, accessibility review, editorial approval, release approval, deployment, public observation,

34
00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:32.427
archive, and external publication are distinct states. A smooth synopsis may

35
00:02:32.427 --> 00:02:37.320
compress navigation, but it cannot absorb specialist claim ownership.

36
00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:41.515
A rendered video may explain a chapter, but cannot promote it.

37
00:02:42.115 --> 00:02:46.255
Now consider a correction. A source passage is withdrawn,

38
00:02:46.255 --> 00:02:51.315
so its mapping changes. The dependency graph identifies the affected claim,

39
00:02:51.315 --> 00:02:55.915
chapter prose, proof commentary, appendix rows, synopsis, transcript, video packet,

40
00:02:55.915 --> 00:02:57.295
and public page.

41
00:02:57.635 --> 00:03:02.348
The claim may be downgraded while the old release remains immutable

42
00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:07.062
and visibly historical. The current derivative becomes stale rather than silently

43
00:03:07.062 --> 00:03:07.490
current.

44
00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.944
Validators can catch missing regeneration and identity drift,

45
00:03:11.944 --> 00:03:17.600
but a human or separately authorized editorial process still owns interpretation,

46
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.685
quality, rights, accessibility approval, and release.

47
00:03:21.025 --> 00:03:25.886
The correction closes only when every reachable consumer is updated, withdrawn,

48
00:03:25.886 --> 00:03:28.980
superseded, or held as an owned residual.

49
00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:35.454
The repository demonstrates portions of this method: generated scaffolds, machine-readable manifests,

50
00:03:35.454 --> 00:03:41.329
source and claim ledgers, schemas, finite Lean models, executable negative controls,

51
00:03:41.329 --> 00:03:46.135
changelog lineage, commit-bound builds, deployed-page crawls, and derivative custody.

52
00:03:46.475 --> 00:03:52.171
The strongest integrated bundle contains three versioned lifecycle slices, twelve cases,

53
00:03:52.171 --> 00:03:57.866
all ten modeled lifecycle states, six observed effects, three exact rollbacks,

54
00:03:57.866 --> 00:04:02.527
a partial-effect residual and quarantine, an eleven-surface sealed epoch,

55
00:04:02.527 --> 00:04:04.080
twenty boundary injections,

56
00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:08.707
and eleven rejecting mutations. That is substantial local publication discipline.

57
00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:12.994
It is not proof that every source interpretation is correct,

58
00:04:12.994 --> 00:04:16.424
every chapter is true, every format is accessible,

59
00:04:16.424 --> 00:04:19.425
or the method transfers to another project.

60
00:04:20.025 --> 00:04:23.808
The core remains Design rationale at argument support.

61
00:04:23.808 --> 00:04:28.536
Its maximum inference is bounded local replay only: no deployment,

62
00:04:28.536 --> 00:04:33.737
whole-book proof, external effect authority, transfer, publication, or release claim follows

63
00:04:33.737 --> 00:04:35.155
from the chapter.

64
00:04:35.495 --> 00:04:38.637
The book is part of its own argument,

65
00:04:38.637 --> 00:04:40.600
but self-application is not self-validation.

66
00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:45.400
The operational test is whether a future agent can discover what

67
00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:49.860
is canonical, what changed, what passed, what failed, what is public,

68
00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:54.320
what remains blocked, and which single roadmap has authority—without private memory.

69
00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:59.090
The next chapter, Open Research Agenda and Bibliography Plan,

70
00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:04.504
turns those unresolved obligations into a durable backlog for reading, building,

71
00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:06.965
testing, proving, reproducing, or rejecting.
